% spec §43: a recursive predicate that also carries its own facts.  The delta
% is seeded with the whole relation and not just with what the seed pass
% derived, so the derivation that starts from path(a, b) -- a row no rule
% produced -- is not lost.
path(a, b).

edge(b, c).
edge(c, d).

path(X, Z) :-
	path(X, Y),
	edge(Y, Z).

path(X, Y)?
